    "title": "Volume Booster - Sound Booster",
    "description": "Volume Booster is a speaker booster and bass booster with a sound equalizer. It can increase the phone volume beyond the maximum media volume and provide high-quality sound. This audio enhancer is a whole mood in your pocket to energize the atmosphere. You can increase the sound volume of dance parties, games, movies, and audiobooks. So download this volume booster for Android and turn your device into a DJ System.\r\n\r\nDo you have bad speakers or low-quality audio output? or just want to adjust the bass volume? The Volume Booster - Sound Booster app with extra sound is here to help. Volume Booster for Android enhances your music quality the way you want. The simple user interface of the speaker booster allows you to quickly master it within seconds. A sound amplifier is the easiest way to boost the volume on speakers and headphones.\r\n\r\n<b>Main Features:</b>\r\n\u2022 Boosts media volume for videos, audiobooks, music, games, etc.\r\n\u2022 Visualizing music for the deaf and hard of hearing.\r\n\u2022 Bass booster and audio enhancer.\r\n\u2022 Simple user interface.\r\n\u2022 Equalizer with multiple preset effects.\r\n\u2022 Increases system volume for alarms, ringtones, etc.\r\n\u2022 Enhances volume without affecting sound quality.\r\n\u2022 Boosts sound for headphones, Bluetooth, and speakers.\r\n\u2022 Allows sound to run in the background or lock screen.\r\n\u2022 Beautiful visual sound spectrum.\r\n\u2022 Boost the sound volume on any music player.\r\n\r\n<b>Enhance the Sound Volume:</b>\r\n\u2022 Sound Booster - Speaker Booster enhances the volume of media and system. \r\n\u2022 Boost volume without compromising sound quality. \r\n\u2022 Useful sound amplifier for louder volume.\r\n\u2022 So turn your mobile phone into a speaker.\r\n\r\n<b>Equalizer & Bass Booster:</b>\r\n\u2022 Speaker Volume - Sound Booster features a powerful bass booster.\r\n\u2022 Max volume booster for impressive bass and sound effects.\r\n\u2022 Customize the equalizer for a truly unique sound experience.\r\n\u2022 Sound equalizer with headphones meets all your needs.\r\n\r\n<b>Extra Volume Booster:</b>\r\n\u2022 Audio Booster - Speaker Booster has a sleek user interface.\r\n\u2022 Sound Amplifier has multiple sound modes to boost phone volume as you like. \r\n\u2022 Sound Booster is an audio enhancer that supports notification bar controls.\r\n\u2022 You can increase/decrease volume and turn the booster on/off with just a tap.\r\n\r\nTake full volume control and turn up the sound power. Sound Booster lets you break the limits of the system and gives you immersive sound quality. Download Volume Booster for headphones & Sound Booster app to enjoy sound to its fullest.\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer:</b>\r\nIf you play audio at high volume for an extended period of time, it can damage your hearing. We recommend gradually increasing the volume to relax your ears. By installing this app you agree that the developer is not responsible for any hardware or hearing damage and that you use it at Your Own Risk.\r\n\r\n<b>Let sound give you power with this Volume Booster - Bass Booster & Audio Enhancer</b>",
